        "text": "I have enough to classify. Key provisions reviewed: § 6.0/6.1 (Purchase of Products / PO cancellation), § 11.0–11.3 (forecast), § 13.0–13.4 (inventory, supply flexibility, EOL), and Appendices 2 and 4."
